			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 117860,
				"to": 131400
			},
			"text": " But the first thing that struck me with this image was all the bypass capacitors, and I couldn't help but thinking, did the designers of this quantum computer just add all the bypass capacitors, just to be sure?"
		},
		{
